<h1>exhaustive search</h1>
<p>
(algorithmic technique)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
An <a href="algorithm.html"><em>algorithm</em></a> that finds a solution by trying every possibility.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="bruteforce.html"><em>brute force</em></a>, <a href="search.html"><em>search</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorBB">BB</a></p>
<h2>More information</h2>
<p>
All the Needles in a Haystack: <a href="https://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/summary?doi=10.1.1.56.9661" target="_blank">Can Exhaustive Search Overcome Combinatorial Chaos?</a>
</p>

